    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Quigley invite you to ignite your imagination and picture yourself living within the comfortable surroundings of no.4 Cedarwood Road. Extending to c.1,291 sqft/120m², this very appealing three-bedroom semi-detached residence has benefitted from a modern makeover and features an extended open-plan kitchen/dining/family room overlooking a private rear garden.\r\n\r\nA bright and inviting entrance hall welcomes you on arrival and leads to the front-facing reception room, which features a new fireplace and provides a comfortable space to sit back and relax, whether watching your favourite television programme or simply enjoying a quiet read.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a wonderful open-plan kitchen/dining/family area that spans the full width of the house. A modern fitted kitchen provides plenty of storage and workspace, while large glazed patio doors open directly onto the garden creating an easy connection between inside and out. A spacious utility room and downstairs guest toilet add further modern convenience. Upstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms together with a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the walled front garden with pillared entrance is paved to provide ample off-street parking. The rear garden enjoys a private aspect and sunny orientation and includes a large, sheltered patio terrace along with plenty of lawn for children to play and for the whole family to enjoy some quality time outdoors.\r\n\r\nCedarwood Road is a mature and well-established residential neighbourhood with an excellent range of amenities close at hand. Local shops, schools and bus services are all available in the immediate vicinity in addition to a variety of sporting and recreational amenities.\r\n\r\nDublin City University, Dublin Airport, the city centre and docklands quarter are all within easy commuting distance, while the nearby M1 and M50 motorway network adds further convenience to this exceptionally well-connected address."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway - 4.7m x 2.0m \r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 342.0m x 3.78m \r\nSpacious front-facing reception room with feature granite fireplace and semi-solid oak flooring\r\n\r\nSitting Room/Kitchen/Dining Room - 8.3m x 7.34m \r\nOpen plan and extended kitchen/dining/family room with tiled floor and feature granite fireplace. Modern fitted kitchen with island unit and stone worktop. Velux windows and sliding glass panelled patio doors accessing garden. Downlighting.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.41m x 2.61m \r\nTiled floor and floor mounted units with stainless steel sink. Access to garage and garden.\r\n\r\nWC - \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 5.06m x 2.71m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 2.42m x 2.72m \r\nStira ladder access to floored attic\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.83m x 3.27m \r\nMaster bedroom with downlighting and new built-in sliding wardrobes. TV point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 2.37m \r\nDouble size bedroom with sliding wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.71m x 2.65m \r\nSpacious third bedroom with sliding wardrobes. Added wall insulation.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.27m x 1.69m \r\nFully tiled bathroom with a new suite to include bath with shower extension and shower screen, whb with floor cabinet and wc. Chrome towel radiator and downlighting.\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nWalled front garden with pillared entrance and paved driveway with ample parking and mature hedge border planting. Walled rear garden with lawn and sheltered patio area.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tExtended & Renovated 3 Bedroom Family Residence\r\n\r\n•\tOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Family Room\r\n\r\n•\tSpacious Utility Room With Access To Garage & Garden\r\n\r\n•\tDownstairs Guest Toilet \r\n\r\n•\tNew Internal Doors, Skirtings & Stair Banister\r\n\r\n•\tUpgraded Family Bathroom with New Suite\r\n\r\n•\t3 Spacious Bedrooms\r\n\r\n•\tFloored Attic With Stira Ladder Access\r\n\r\n•\tPrivate Driveway With Ample Parking\r\n\r\n•\tNew Gas Central Heating Boiler"
      },
      {
